  "description": "In Season 3, in addition to the familiar Mysterious Amusement Park and Candy Paradise, many new locations—including a lively performance stage—will make their debut!<br><br>\nFurthermore, joining the ranks of our active heroes like PetitCure Mofurun and PetitCure Pollun, new friends such as PetitCure Purirun and PetitCure Meroron will also be appearing!<br><br>\nEverything is even cuter when you're with a friend! ♪<br><br>\nPlease look forward to more heartwarming and humorous stories that will leave you feeling cozy and healed by all the cute PetitCure. ♡<br><br>\n\n(Source: Official Website)",
